<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "チュートリアル" "グラフィック\メニュー\右クリック\ワード\チュートリアル場所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "350" "70" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Here, it is possible to view information on the places that appear in this world.<PG>
<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama, there are likely places that do not exist in your world, so it would be well to view them here, even place names you have seen.<PG>
As the scenarios progress, the places you can view will increase as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "チュートリアル" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
